[training setup]
model   : DDQN / AttentionQNetwork (269,321 trainable parameters)
arch    : 
            [agent encoder]     Linear(2->256) -> LayerNorm -> ReLU
            [ball encoder]      Linear(4->256) -> LayerNorm -> ReLU  (x,y,vx,vy; x,y는 agent 기준 상대좌표. 공 40개에 각각 동일하게 적용, 파라미터 공유)
            [+ sentinel]        학습되는 '공 없음' key/value 1개 추가 (항상 마스킹 안 함)
            [cross-attention]   Q=agent embed(1개) , K=V=ball embed(40개)+sentinel(1개) -> 4 head x 64dim -> softmax(QK^T/sqrt(d))·V (mask=0인 빈 슬롯은 attention에서 제외)
            [out_proj]          Linear(256->256)
            [combine]           agent embed + attention -> LayerNorm -> ReLU
            [head]              Linear(256->9)
run     : device=cuda, seed=0, episodes=3000
optim   : lr=0.0001, gamma=0.99, batch=32, buffer=100000, hidden=256, layer_norm=True, dueling_net=False, use_attention=True(4 heads, fusion=residual, position=relative), augmentation=False(spawn_safe), loss_fn=mse, max_grad_norm=10
